    "Do not mirror entire providers indiscriminately.",
    "Prefer the best-fit 1-3 candidates per warehouse slot before duplication.",
    "Public/source-compatible lanes may be staged automatically only when access policy allows it.",
    "Authentication, account, purchase, marketplace and manual-license lanes remain preparation/manual-review only until explicit access exists.",
    "Every staged file requires provider, source page, license/entitlement, local receipt, SHA256, size and intended slot.",
    "Animated final production assets must be FBX.",
    "Production textures must be PNG/TGA; use channel packing where appropriate; BMP is forbidden.",
    "Audio production masters must be WAV before UE import.",
    "Heavy runtime assets remain soft referenced and asynchronously loaded with FStreamableManager.",
    "Repeated world detail uses ISM/HISM; crowd/common transient actors use pooling.",
    "No warehouse-preparation car opens a new runtime chapter or changes story anchors."
  ],
